NOTE: This license covers original code and prose authored in this
repository. It does NOT cover:

- third-party model weights (governed by their own licenses, e.g. Apache-2.0
  for Qwen3 official repositories — see `config/models.yaml` once populated);
- third-party datasets/benchmarks (governed by their own licenses/terms of
  use — see `literature/references.csv` and dataset cards under `data/`);
- reference PDFs retained under `ref/` for research/citation-verification
  purposes (governed by publisher/institutional access terms, not
  redistributed via this repository);
- Qur'an/Hadith source texts (governed by the terms of the authoritative
  source used to construct the corpus; canonical sacred text is never
  altered — see `paper.md` §18).

License scope and final release scope (code only vs. code+prompts vs.
code+prompts+derived corpus metadata) are subject to Decision Gate DG-12 in
`paper.md`.
